t('gwsCol.Bild.hint')\"\r\n   />\r\n```\r\nit throws me this error when I click on `clearable`:\r\n![Bildschirmfoto zu 2021-08-12 15-18-12](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7381054/129203727-be2be1ea-80e5-4475-84ec-cade5632db40.png)\r\n\r\nIf I  use `v-model` w/o `.trim` it works.\r\nCan anyone confirm? Or where is my mistake?  (it works in Q1)\r\n\r\n(Info:   » Pkg quasar........ v2.0.3    » Pkg @quasar/app... v3.0.4 )\r\n</div>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quasarframework/quasar/issues/10376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quasarframework/quasar/issues/10376/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/1111540778","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/5765#issuecomment-1111540778","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/5765","id":1111540778,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCCum185CQMQq","user":{"login":"qxygene","id":2819611,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MTk2MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2819611?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene","html_url":"https://github.com/qxygene","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qxygene/received_events","type":"User","user_view_ty